Add bonusFmt() for percentage-based bonuses — always displays
2 decimal places (e.g. RM 496.50 instead of RM 496).
Applied to all bonus_amount fields in Streak tab, totals,
paid/pending summaries, and player streak mini-badges.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DqGp4gVeTBMvwho4pP8n8C
